node553 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>trackStar</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/trackStar' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/trackStar</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;(&quot;Track\*&quot; in the SSVC spec) The vulnerability contains specific characteristics that may require closer monitoring for changes. CISA recommends remediating Track\* vulnerabilities within standard update timelines.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
